<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Reset your password</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F9FC;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;color:#102A43;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F7F9FC;padding:32px 16px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;max-width:560px;width:100%;">
<tr><td style="background:#0A1628;padding:28px 32px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:#ffffff;">Earn With <span style="color:#C9A227;">Ali Bhai</span></div>
<div style="color:#9fb0c3;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;">Learn real skills. Grow with barakah.</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px;">
<p style="font-size:16px;">Assalam-o-Alaikum <%= name %>,</p>
<p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">We received a request to reset your password. Click the button below to choose a new one.</p>
<p style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
<a href="<%= link %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#0E7C5B;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:12px;">Reset my password</a>
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#5B6B7C;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#0E7C5B;word-break:break-all;"><%= link %></p>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#5B6B7C;">This link is single-use and expires in 1 hour. If you didn't request this, just ignore this email — your password stays the same.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#F7F9FC;padding:20px 32px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#5B6B7C;">© Earn With Ali Bhai · support@earnwithalibhai.com</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
